      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just about finding \"new meaning\"... that's what people say to be nice. but the truth is, the person who was capable of making those life or death calls is gone. i look in the mirror and i don't even recognize the person staring back. i've done my time. i've fulfilled everything i was meant to do. it feels like the story is already over, and i'm just reading the epilogue over and over again.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
